"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5251270","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-1959360-1846651706692861","game_id":"steam-1959360","kind":"announcement","title":"Topsoil Town Demo Out Now!","summary":"I'm excited to announce that the Topsoil Town demo is now live for Next Fest!The October Next Fest has begun, and with it you can now play the Topsoil Town demo! Grab some friends and finally settle who is the coziest amongst you!Played the demo already? Let me know what you thought in the community forum! While you're there, check out the FAQ to learn more about the game and what to expect from the demo! You can also also check out the How to Play post if you want to learn the rules of the game","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T21:47:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692861","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1959360-1846651706688899","game_id":"steam-1959360","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes 0.1.1250","summary":"New Content & Balance Changes:Added icons for cats, dogs, and fish.Visual pass on most item icons.Various UI visual improvements.Added page count to how to play menu.New input prompts & support for PlayStation/Switch prompts.Added aspiration suggested difficulty.Increased default starting money.Made seeds millable.Reduced Angler starting bait from 15 to 10.Removed Animal XP reward for purchasing animals. Bugfixes:Fixed an issue causing focus to be stuck when selecting the side panel at home or i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T05:41:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688899","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1959360-1846018067943930","game_id":"steam-1959360","kind":"announcement","title":"How to Play Topsoil Town","summary":"Want to learn the rules to Topsoil Town before you hop in? I've got you covered!With the October Next Fest right around the corner, it's time to start studying up if you want to live the coziest life! Check out the official game rules below and start planning your strategy!How to Play1. How to WinTo win the game, earn the most: Money Happiness Skill Mastery The player with the highest combined score at the end of the final season wins the game! Tip: The color of your score indicator changes as i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T13:00:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943930","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1959360-1844115010504273","game_id":"steam-1959360","kind":"announcement","title":"Topsoil Town is Coming to Next Fest!","summary":"I am excited to announce that Topsoil Town is coming to the October 2026 Edition of Steam Next Fest! The demo has officially been reviewed and approved by Valve and I will be working hard over the next several weeks to finalize the build. I look forward to sharing more news and information about the game as we get closer to the release of the demo. Make sure to wishlist and follow the store page to keep up to date! -","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T14:00:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010504273","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-1959360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checke